3. Permissions. You may, free of charge:
   a) view and read the source code in the official repository; and
   b) download and install the official binaries published by the Owner in the
      repository's Releases section and use them to manage your personal finances
      for non-commercial purposes.

4. Restrictions. Without the Owner's prior written permission, you may not:
   a) copy, reproduce or download the source code for any purpose other than
